{"id":"wb-1-83","name":"光孝寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"光孝寺 (广州)","text":"光孝寺，全称为报恩光孝禅寺，位于广东省广州市越秀区六榕街道彭家巷社区光孝路109号。是广州市历史最悠久的寺院建筑、广州市四大丛林（光孝、六榕、华林、海幢）之一，亦为广东省佛教协会的所在地，有差不多2000年的历史，正门重新修建，并补上赵朴初手书“光孝寺”匾额。门两旁有对联：“五羊论古寺”、“初地访诃林”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%89%E5%AD%9D%E5%AF%BA_(%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":95114659,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95114659","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/762fb755eaa453333fbd37e3.jpg","title":"Guangzhou_Guangxiao_Si_2012.11.15_16-41-08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guangzhou_Guangxiao_Si_2012.11.15_16-41-08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/Guangzhou_Guangxiao_Si_2012.11.15_16-41-08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"广州光孝寺 ——\n\n大雄宝殿东南角","width":320,"height":213}}